      },
      {
         "id": "105a9799-5da8-45a4-81a5-b2248a2525a6",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "1adedc53-a246-49d1-aa42-cee0fd3aa553",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=1adedc53-a246-49d1-aa42-cee0fd3aa553",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Avaliando as Unidades\n\nO dígito das unidades de 12 é 2, e 2 é menor que 7. Isso significa que não podemos subtrair 7 apenas das 2 unidades.\n\nEntão reorganizamos os números usando as ordens que lembramos:\n\n12 − 7 =\n(2 + 10) − 7 =\n2 + (10 − 7)\n\nNa figura, os sete quadrados amarelos claros desbotados são os 7 que retiramos da dezena. Os três quadrados amarelos claros que restam são o complemento de 7 para 10. Os dois quadrados azuis claros são as unidades de 12.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 56\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:760px; display:block; margin:0 auto;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sete quadrados amarelo claro desbotados, três quadrados amarelo claro e dois quadrados azul claro\"><title>Sete quadrados amarelo claro desbotados, três quadrados amarelo claro e dois quadrados azul claro</title><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"64\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"192\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"256\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"384\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"448\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"512\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"576\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"640\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"704\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figura 3</b>: Sete quadrados amarelos claros desbotados (os 7 retirados), três quadrados amarelos claros (o complemento) e dois quadrados azuis claros (as unidades).</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "fd64c19f-90a5-48cc-8d89-39ed7f876319",
         "prev": "fd4fe060-1e86-4c87-a552-984d857b26a2",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "fd64c19f-90a5-48cc-8d89-39ed7f876319",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "1adedc53-a246-49d1-aa42-cee0fd3aa553",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=1adedc53-a246-49d1-aa42-cee0fd3aa553",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### O Resultado\n\nAgora podemos terminar o cálculo:\n\n10 − 7 = 3\n2 + 3 = 5\n\nAssim, 12 − 7 = 5. Na figura abaixo, os sete quadrados amarelos claros desbotados são os 7 que retiramos, e os cinco quadrados azuis claros são o resultado. Juntos, eles ainda mostram os 12 com que começamos.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 56\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:760px; display:block; margin:0 auto;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sete quadrados amarelo claro desbotados e cinco quadrados azul claro\"><title>Sete quadrados amarelo claro desbotados e cinco quadrados azul claro representando o cálculo 12 menos 7 igual a 5</title><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"64\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"192\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"256\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"384\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"448\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"512\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"576\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"640\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"704\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figura 4</b>: Sete quadrados amarelos claros desbotados (os 7 retirados) e cinco quadrados azuis claros (o resultado).</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "054e630a-ef4a-46be-b3ae-2697dafd9a7b",
